        <h2 class="ph-h3">One partner, from propagation to delivery</h2>
        <p class="ph-copy">Our nursery in Al Ajban, Abu Dhabi is the operational heart of every project: plants are propagated, grown, received, inspected and prepared to project specifications before delivery.</p>
        <p class="ph-copy">Imported material is consolidated at our Ajban nursery, inspected and acclimatised before supply across the Emirates and wider Gulf.</p>
